title: $:/plugins/yan/hypergsd-contexts/readme
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

''HyperGSD Contexts'' is a sub-plugin of [[HyperGSD|$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd]] that adds the //Context// type and has the following benefits:

* Offers easy ways to enter context on GSD tiddlers
* Offers dashboards and grouping mechanisms to look through your actions/projects by context.

! What it ships

* The `context` member of the [[type tag list|Type tag list]] — contexts are ordinary tags tagged `GSD/Contexts` (the dashboard tiddler itself is the tag list); an action can carry several at once.
* The [[GSD/Contexts]] dashboard: create contexts and list them.
* The context view template: a context's page shows its next/waiting/future actions, optionally grouped by project.
* The contextualise row button: the contexts icon on any incomplete action's row opens an inline picker to add or create contexts in place — a typed name that matches no tiddler is created tagged `GSD/Contexts` and applied. Contexts already on the action show as core tag pills beside the icon; clicking a pill opens that context (each row's picker toggles independently). The pills can be hidden via Settings → Dashboards → Context page ("Show tagged contexts with links" — the checkbox links to its `$:/config/hypergsd/Contexts/show-contexts` tiddler, core-control-panel style).
* The new-item modal's context section and the capture sidebar's "Default context:" control and //new context// button.

Being simple tags, context will be automatically inherited when you create actions from a tiddler.